  "reading": {
    "zh": "按所验证的子系统分组：夹具与文件系统持久性（新增 FUSE 桥）、事务/参与者补偿/崩溃矩阵、执行平面、队列与精确一次保证、VScript 语言及其审计轨迹/撤销/cron/触发器、治理与契约，最后是日志盘、CLI 与打包检查。",
    "en": "Grouped by the subsystem each module validates: fixtures and filesystem durability (now including the FUSE bridge), transactions, participant compensation and crash matrices, the execution plane, queue and exactly-once guarantees, the VScript language with its audit trail, undo, cron and triggers, governance and contracts, and finally log-disk, CLI and packaging checks."
  },
